# Shared Skills & Commands

Claude Code and Cursor share skills/commands via cross-references. When creating a new skill:

- **New Cursor skill** (`.cursor/skills/foo/SKILL.md`): also create `.claude/commands/foo.md` referencing the shared content
- **New content from a Claude Code command/agent**: create `.cursor/skills/foo/SKILL.md` with frontmatter + `@.claude/commands/foo.md` or `@.claude/agents/foo.md`

Content lives in one place; the other tool gets a pointer file. Never duplicate the content.
